# AI UX Playground / `npx skills add` writes a second local skills root.
# Work Kit vendors chosen skills under skills/. Do not commit the dump.
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# The Verdant design system ships open-licensed (OFL) fonts committed under
# design-system/fonts/. The optional purchased commercial fonts (Juturu, Lenia
# Sans, Virtus Verona, Bombshell) may be dropped in the same folder locally but
# must NOT be committed to this public repo — ignore those families by name.
design-system/fonts/Juturu-*
design-system/fonts/LeniaSans-*
design-system/fonts/VirtusVerona-*
design-system/fonts/Bombshell-*
